1
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:57,000
Don't let emotions affect your studies.

2
00:00:58,079 --> 00:00:59,200
Study hard.

3
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:01,600
That's what you're supposed to do.

4
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:16,319
You've improved a lot.

5
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:19,000
Thank you, Teacher.

6
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,439
Keep up the good work.

7
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,959
Teacher, here's the book you lent me.

8
00:01:31,959 --> 00:01:32,840
Thank you.

9
00:01:33,239 --> 00:01:33,959
How was it?

10
00:01:34,599 --> 00:01:35,760
Did you find it helpful?

11
00:01:35,959 --> 00:01:37,560
It's not that it didn't help.

12
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,840
But it probably won't work on my dad.

13
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,680
He always tells me he's very busy,

14
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:43,599
and that his workplace is strict and all.

15
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:48,599
But I feel like he's hiding something.

16
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:51,079
When I try to help, he won't listen,

17
00:01:51,079 --> 00:01:53,480
but he tries to control everything I do.

18
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:56,799
Maybe your dad has his reasons.

19
00:01:59,079 --> 00:02:01,560
You two just need to communicate more.

20
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:03,439
I really want to communicate with him, too.

21
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:05,280
But whenever I ask about him,

22
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,640
he just avoids the topic entirely.

23
00:02:06,879 --> 00:02:09,680
Try to be more understanding of your dad.

24
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,080
It hasn't been easy for him either.

25
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:15,039
He's been out making money for years.

26
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:18,159
He hasn't realized you're an adult now.

27
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:20,759
So he makes all your decisions for you.

28
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:24,400
I think you need to become independent.

29
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,080
Make him realize

30
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,560
that you're a grown woman now.

31
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,960
I understand, Teacher.

32
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,560
Thank you for your advice.

33
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,479
I'll be going now.

34
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:38,879
Goodbye, Teacher.

35
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:17,800
Will you marry me?

36
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,080
I'm sorry.

37
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,280
I didn't see you there.

38
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,039
Excuse me.

39
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:35,599
It's fine.

40
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,120
You can read it.

41
00:03:38,639 --> 00:03:39,719
I've already read this one.

42
00:03:39,719 --> 00:03:41,240
I just wanted to reread it.

43
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:43,800
If you like it, you can read it first.

44
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,039
Really?

45
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,439
I actually wanted to reread it too.

46
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,479
You like mystery novels too?

47
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,240
Yeah.

48
00:03:51,479 --> 00:03:53,080
Arthur Conan Doyle, Agatha Christie.

49
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,759
And Keigo Higashino.

50
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:57,039
My sky had no sun,

51
00:03:58,719 --> 00:03:59,719
it was always night.

52
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:03,719
But it was never dark.

53
00:04:05,479 --> 00:04:08,280
Something was there in place of the sun.

54
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,280
Here, you read this one.

55
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:14,879
I'll take this one.

56
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,519
Oh, right.

57
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,519
Um...

58
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:22,560
Do you have time

59
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,560
to sit down and chat?

60
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:27,959
Just to talk about mysteries.

61
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:40,920
Old Six.

62
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,920
I'll say this one more time.

63
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:45,160
The elderly, pregnant women,

64
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,480
the disabled, and children...

65
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,040
I absolutely won't touch them.

66
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:48,920
Don't push me.

67
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,040
If you push me again,

68
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,360
I'm capable of anything.

69
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,480
Don't worry.

70
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,480
The one you've chatted with for two weeks,

71
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:55,920
that landlady, Ms. Wu.

72
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:56,920
Her?

73
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,920
She's fine.

74
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,319
She's already taken the bait.

75
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,480
But chatting online isn't working well.

76
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,959
You need to meet her in person.

77
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:04,839
Remember,

78
00:05:04,839 --> 00:05:05,959
your current identity is

79
00:05:06,079 --> 00:05:08,560
a quantitative fund trading manager.

80
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,319
Since you're on a six-month business trip,

81
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:11,920
you want to rent her place long-term.

82
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,240
After you meet,

83
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,720
you need to guide her to invest in funds.

84
00:05:14,839 --> 00:05:15,639
Understand?

85
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:17,720
Understood. No problem.

86
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,079
Here.

87
00:05:19,519 --> 00:05:20,319
Thanks.

88
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:27,560
You study medicine?

89
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:28,879
Yeah.

90
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,360
I'm a medical grad student.

91
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:31,639
How about you?

92
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:32,959
Me?

93
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,279
I just type on a keyboard.

94
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:36,439
A programmer.

95
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:38,519
I usually like to read

96
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,560
and write a little.

97
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:41,040
That's pretty impressive.

98
00:05:43,519 --> 00:05:44,319
Not really.

99
00:05:51,759 --> 00:05:52,920
She looks so much like Sun Yao.

100
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,600
Could Gu Yan still be the killer?

101
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:00,199
I need to find a way into the fraud syndicate first.

102
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:04,240
Is there something on my face?

103
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:06,120
No, no.

104
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,160
You look a lot like a friend of mine.

105
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:18,160
A very important friend.

106
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,279
Or maybe...

107
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:21,279
a girlfriend?

108
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,560
Mr. Gu?

109
00:06:29,839 --> 00:06:30,720
Ms. Wu, right?

110
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,560
Yes, yes.

111
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,360
Hello.

112
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:35,560
You look sharper than in your photos!

113
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:37,000
You flatter me.

114
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:39,439
Should we go see the apartment now?

115
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,480
No need. I trust you.

116
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,000
Mr. Gu, as for this apartment...

117
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,360
I've held it for you for half a month.

118
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:45,759
So about the deposit...

119
00:06:45,759 --> 00:06:46,319
No problem.

120
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:47,240
How much?

121
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,079
3,000 yuan.

122
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,920
Any less and I'll rent it to someone else.

123
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:50,959
No problem.

124
00:06:50,959 --> 00:06:52,040
I'll transfer it to you now.

125
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,120
You're really straightforward.

126
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,360
Just what you'd expect from an investor.

127
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,959
You must make a lot of money, right?

128
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,160
To be honest with you,

129
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,759
I just get a fixed salary.

130
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,959
But I have some pretty reliable inside info.

131
00:07:04,959 --> 00:07:05,959
Guaranteed returns.

132
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,279
Really?

133
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:08,160
Look,

134
00:07:10,279 --> 00:07:11,759
I've only been trading for a few days,

135
00:07:11,759 --> 00:07:12,839
and I'm already up over 100,000.

136
00:07:12,959 --> 00:07:13,920
It's that profitable?

137
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:15,759
Can I invest a little?

138
00:07:19,279 --> 00:07:20,120
Sure.

139
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,759
Under your roof, I must help you earn.

140
00:07:22,759 --> 00:07:23,759
That's great!

141
00:07:23,759 --> 00:07:24,639
Let's do it together then!

142
00:07:24,639 --> 00:07:25,959
But don't tell anyone else.

143
00:07:26,839 --> 00:07:28,319
Okay, then I'll invest 300,000.

144
00:07:28,439 --> 00:07:30,920
Then wait for me at the Commune Cafe next door.

145
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,120
I'll go get the money for you now.

146
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:32,959
Wait for me!

147
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:33,879
Okay, okay.

148
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,759
You said you write novels.

149
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:42,279
Do you want to be a writer?

150
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:43,759
I wouldn't call myself a writer.

151
00:07:44,279 --> 00:07:46,000
I'm just starting on my first book.

152
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:47,439
By the way,

153
00:07:48,079 --> 00:07:49,639
you're a medical grad student, right?

154
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:50,279
Yeah.

155
00:07:50,279 --> 00:07:51,720
So if I ever have any questions,

156
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,360
can I ask you?

157
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,879
Of course.

158
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,680
But,

159
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:59,240
you have to promise me one thing.

160
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:03,759
Let's hear it.

161
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:05,120
As long as I can do it.

162
00:08:06,759 --> 00:08:08,759
When you finish writing this novel,

163
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:10,639
I want to be your first reader.

164
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,959
I thought you'd make me buy you dinner.

165
00:08:14,519 --> 00:08:15,519
No problem.

166
00:08:15,519 --> 00:08:16,360
I promise,

167
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,480
you'll be the first reader.

168
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,000
Then let's

169
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,360
add each other on WeChat.

170
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:24,639
I'll scan you.

171
00:08:28,759 --> 00:08:29,920
Little punk.

172
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,240
Hitting on my daughter?

173
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,360
Once I get my hands on that 300,000,

174
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,559
I'll bury you in cash.

175
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,159
You scammer!

176
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,919
Good thing a kind soul warned me.

177
00:08:45,919 --> 00:08:47,480
I almost fell for it.

178
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:49,519
Forget about getting your deposit back.

179
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:53,120
My 3,000 yuan!

180
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:54,919
You can't just focus on his flaws.

181
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,320
Think about his strengths.

182
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,200
Strengths?

183
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,440
He definitely has some quirks.

184
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,879
He's incredibly timid.

185
00:09:00,519 --> 00:09:02,679
Wh-What's wrong?

186
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:05,120
Nothing, it's just a bit hot.

187
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,440
Actually, I need to use the restroom.

188
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,000
Just wait here for a moment.

189
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:09,559
Okay.

190
00:09:32,879 --> 00:09:33,759
If you don't want to die,

191
00:09:33,759 --> 00:09:34,879
stay away from my daughter.

192
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,240
Your daughter is exceptional.

193
00:09:38,159 --> 00:09:39,240
I really want to be friends with her.

194
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,720
You wanna die?

195
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,480
You're asking for it!

196
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,919
You wanna die, punk?!

197
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:50,679
Stop hitting him! Stop!

198
00:09:50,679 --> 00:09:51,360
Get lost!

199
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,159
Stop hitting him! Stop!

200
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:53,440
Dad, what are you doing?

201
00:09:57,279 --> 00:09:58,159
Let me explain.

202
00:09:58,159 --> 00:09:59,039
It's not what it looks like.

203
00:09:59,039 --> 00:09:59,919
It's right in front of my eyes.

204
00:09:59,919 --> 00:10:00,919
What's there to explain?

205
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,200
No...

206
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:04,039
This kid...

207
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:04,559
He actually...

208
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,519
If you don't want her to know,

209
00:10:06,519 --> 00:10:07,480
you better behave.

210
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,159
You...

211
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,720
No, he's a friend I just made today.

212
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,919
Why did you hit him?

213
00:10:13,919 --> 00:10:15,440
Just because of your need for control?

214
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,159
What kind of father acts like this?

215
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,759
He even controls her choice of friends.

216
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,480
I bet he commits domestic violence.

217
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,480
Mind your own business!

218
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,720
I've really had enough.

219
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:25,720
Now you even control what friends I make.

220
00:10:26,159 --> 00:10:27,080
No, sweetie.

221
00:10:27,159 --> 00:10:28,360
It's not that I want to control you.

222
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,519
It's this kid... He actually...

223
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:30,639
Let me be clear.

224
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:31,720
I like him!

225
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:32,840
Don't even think about controlling me!

226
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,519
But he...

227
00:10:35,519 --> 00:10:35,879
Let's go.

228
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:47,720
Hold still.

229
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:51,919
All done.

230
00:10:55,039 --> 00:10:56,320
Get some good rest.

231
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,320
They're just superficial wounds.

232
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,200
Nothing serious.

233
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,360
Remember to apply the ointment regularly.

234
00:10:59,399 --> 00:11:01,200
Doctor, is he really okay?

235
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,840
He was beaten up pretty badly.

236
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:05,799
He's fine. Your boyfriend is quite tough.

237
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:07,960
He wouldn't stay if you hadn't insisted.

238
00:11:08,639 --> 00:11:09,480
I... I...

239
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,039
We're not together.

240
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:13,159
Lovebirds haven't been dating long, huh?

241
00:11:13,159 --> 00:11:14,039
Don't worry.

242
00:11:14,039 --> 00:11:15,440
Just press the bell if you need anything.

243
00:11:20,039 --> 00:11:20,840
Um...

244
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,799
So...

245
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:29,200
Please don't mind what I said earlier.

246
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,919
I just said it to piss my dad off.

247
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,399
I didn't mean anything by it.

248
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:36,519
Today is the first time we've met.

249
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,720
I'm not usually this casual.

250
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,399
I know.

251
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,440
Your dad was just trying to protect you.

252
00:11:44,919 --> 00:11:47,440
Just go back and have a proper talk.

253
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:51,000
Don't fall out with him because of me.

254
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:54,000
Thank you, Li Wen.

255
00:11:57,039 --> 00:11:57,840
Yeah.

256
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:09,039
Her phone's off.

257
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:14,200
Guess she's not planning to come home.

258
00:12:23,519 --> 00:12:24,399
Hello?

259
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,519
Did you find her?

260
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:26,840
I found her. I found her.

261
00:12:27,159 --> 00:12:28,000
She's at the suburban hospital.

262
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,759
Inpatient ward, third floor, Room 06.

263
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:55,919
Yaoyao

264
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,399
I will find the truth

265
00:12:59,279 --> 00:13:00,200
and clear your name
